# Canei Subirats — release credentials (fill once).
#
# Copy this file to  fastlane/.env.default  and paste the 3 API-key values below
# (Team ID + bundle id are already baked into the project).
# fastlane loads .env.default automatically for every lane, so after this you
# never type these again — just run `make ship` (or `bundle exec fastlane beta`).
#
# .env.default is gitignored — your key never lands in the repo.
#
# Where each value comes from (App Store Connect → Users and Access → Integrations
# → App Store Connect API):
ASC_KEY_ID=XXXXXXXXXX
ASC_ISSUER_ID=xxxxxxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx

# Path to the AuthKey_XXXXXXXXXX.p8 you downloaded (keep it OUTSIDE the repo,
# e.g. in ~/.appstoreconnect/). Either point to the file…
ASC_KEY_P8_PATH=/Users/you/.appstoreconnect/AuthKey_XXXXXXXXXX.p8
# …or paste the key contents inline instead (leave PATH blank if you use this):
# ASC_KEY_P8=

# Team ID and bundle id are already baked into the project (5V62K942X6 /
# com.caneisubirats.erp), so you normally leave these two commented out.
# Uncomment only to override.
# DEVELOPER_TEAM_ID=5V62K942X6
# APP_BUNDLE_ID=com.caneisubirats.erp
